{"id":"n49672-2-7","stage":1,"title":"따로 · 另行","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n49672-2-7-1","ko":"동창회에서 너랑 제대로 얘기도 못 하고 헤어지려니 아쉽네.","zh":"在同学聚会上没能好好和你聊聊，就要分开啦，真有点遗憾。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"동창회에서","meaning":"校友会","explanation":"동창회：校友会；에서：格助词，表示动作发生的地点或出发点。","readings":[{"term":"동창회","audio":"/audio/144b00af1ad84ad8336d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"48106","senseId":"1","lemma":"동창회","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"동창회에서","audio":"/audio/ad257afdf17feb7f7728.mp3"}},{"text":"너랑","meaning":"你","explanation":"너：你；랑：连接共同参与或比较的对象，常表示“和、与”；结合句中动作理解。","readings":[{"term":"너","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64390","senseId":"1","lemma":"너","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"너랑","audio":"/audio/32c7250ffa53acbc7ea0.mp3"}},{"text":"제대로","meaning":"正常地，正规地","explanation":"제대로：正常地，正规地","readings":[{"term":"제대로","audio":"/audio/085882b8f444c8cf0f5f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70896","senseId":"1","lemma":"제대로","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"제대로","audio":"/audio/085882b8f444c8cf0f5f.mp3"}},{"text":"얘기도","meaning":"谈话，说话","explanation":"얘기：谈话，说话；도：表示“也、连……也”。","readings":[{"term":"얘기","audio":"/audio/cbb7c3fe2dd88ddc7d2b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"74194","senseId":"1","lemma":"얘기","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"얘기도","audio":"/audio/755f28fff0aeed6826b4.mp3"}},{"text":"못","meaning":"不能、没能（能力或条件限制）","explanation":"못：不能、没能（能力或条件限制）","readings":[{"term":"못","audio":"/audio/89058d16546c11076dd1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17254","senseId":"1","lemma":"못","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"못","audio":"/audio/89058d16546c11076dd1.mp3"}},{"text":"하고","meaning":"做、进行（얘기를 하다：交谈）","explanation":"하다：做、进行（얘기를 하다：交谈）；고：连接并列或先后的动作、状态；也用于 -고 있다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"1","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"하고","audio":"/audio/1a7140c02481d065b267.mp3"}},{"text":"헤어지려니","meaning":"分别，分离","explanation":"헤어지다：分别，分离；려니：说明正要或打算做某事时所遇到的情况、想法或困难。","readings":[{"term":"헤어지다","audio":"/audio/55df2acaad2147f202aa.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58271","senseId":"1","lemma":"헤어지다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"헤어지려니","audio":"/audio/906dc137704c01a13a62.mp3"}},{"text":"아쉽네.","meaning":"可惜，舍不得，依依不舍","explanation":"아쉽다：可惜，舍不得，依依不舍；네：对新发现的情况表示感叹或确认，非敬语句末。","readings":[{"term":"아쉽다","audio":"/audio/b90537aecebf988b4b9b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"14687","senseId":"2","lemma":"아쉽다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"아쉽네","audio":"/audio/a633e56f857e0e069657.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"144b00af1ad84ad8","term":"동창회","zh":"校友会","audio":"/audio/144b00af1ad84ad8336d.mp3","entryId":"48106","definition":"从同一个学校毕业的人们举行的聚会。","pronunciation":["동창회","동창훼"]},{"id":"734dae8e9d9a8f8b","term":"너","zh":"你","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3","entryId":"64390","definition":"指代听者，用于朋友或晚辈。","pronunciation":["너"]},{"id":"085882b8f444c8cf","term":"제대로","zh":"正常地，正规地","audio":"/audio/085882b8f444c8cf0f5f.mp3","entryId":"70896","definition":"以正确格式或标准、样子。","pronunciation":["제대로"]},{"id":"cbb7c3fe2dd88ddc","term":"얘기","zh":"谈话，说话","audio":"/audio/cbb7c3fe2dd88ddc7d2b.mp3","entryId":"74194","definition":"向某人诉说与某事实、状态、现象、经验、想法等有关的话。","pronunciation":["얘ː기"]},{"id":"89058d16546c1107","term":"못","zh":"不能、没能（能力或条件限制）","audio":"/audio/89058d16546c11076dd1.mp3","entryId":"17254","definition":"不会做动词所指的动作。","pronunciation":["몯ː"]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"做、进行（얘기를 하다：交谈）","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"73277","definition":"做、进行（얘기를 하다：交谈）","pronunciation":["하다"]},{"id":"55df2acaad2147f2","term":"헤어지다","zh":"分别，分离","audio":"/audio/55df2acaad2147f202aa.mp3","entryId":"58271","definition":"和在一起的人分开。","pronunciation":["헤어지다"]},{"id":"b90537aecebf988b","term":"아쉽다","zh":"可惜，舍不得，依依不舍","audio":"/audio/b90537aecebf988b4b9b.mp3","entryId":"14687","definition":"存有一些留恋而感到惋惜、遗憾。","pronunciation":["아쉽따"]}],"audio":"/audio/93a5618dd6f09debf39f.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n49672-2-7-2","ko":"다음에 따로 약속을 잡아서 만나자.","zh":"下次我们单独约个时间再见面吧。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"다음에","meaning":"以后，下次","explanation":"다음：以后，下次；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"다음","audio":"/audio/aef613c6612d424ab454.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64531","senseId":"5","lemma":"다음","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"다음에","audio":"/audio/2a722c75f1d5ba8ef482.mp3"}},{"text":"따로","meaning":"另行，别的，不同地","explanation":"따로：另行，别的，不同地","readings":[{"term":"따로","audio":"/audio/6d325aa9f77b0fc574c1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"49672","senseId":"2","lemma":"따로","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"따로","audio":"/audio/6d325aa9f77b0fc574c1.mp3"}},{"text":"약속을","meaning":"约定，约好，承诺","explanation":"약속：约定，约好，承诺；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"약속","audio":"/audio/a39ee87db456831ef069.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"36695","senseId":"1","lemma":"약속","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"약속을","audio":"/audio/0ed9c6c878095dc754c9.mp3"}},{"text":"잡아서","meaning":"定","explanation":"잡다：定；어서：连接原因与结果，或前后相接的动作。","readings":[{"term":"잡다","audio":"/audio/b8cc8df3de72c173aa21.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70378","senseId":"13","lemma":"잡다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"잡아서","audio":"/audio/098abfdc1d6362ae0b0f.mp3"}},{"text":"만나자.","meaning":"见面，相逢","explanation":"만나다：见面，相逢；자：非敬语提议句末：“一起……吧”。","readings":[{"term":"만나다","audio":"/audio/b1bced847edb7e2eec5e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66591","senseId":"2","lemma":"만나다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"만나자","audio":"/audio/db87772a2bc5c2996a99.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"aef613c6612d424a","term":"다음","zh":"以后，下次","audio":"/audio/aef613c6612d424ab454.mp3","entryId":"64531","definition":"一段时间后。","pronunciation":["다음"]},{"id":"6d325aa9f77b0fc5","term":"따로","zh":"另行，别的，不同地","audio":"/audio/6d325aa9f77b0fc574c1.mp3","entryId":"49672","definition":"跟普通的不一样，比较特别。","pronunciation":["따로"]},{"id":"a39ee87db456831e","term":"약속","zh":"约定，约好，承诺","audio":"/audio/a39ee87db456831ef069.mp3","entryId":"36695","definition":"事先决定与他人一起做某事；或指那样定下的内容。","pronunciation":["약쏙"]},{"id":"b8cc8df3de72c173","term":"잡다","zh":"定","audio":"/audio/b8cc8df3de72c173aa21.mp3","entryId":"70378","definition":"决定计划、意见、日期等。","pronunciation":["잡따"]},{"id":"b1bced847edb7e2e","term":"만나다","zh":"见面，相逢","audio":"/audio/b1bced847edb7e2eec5e.mp3","entryId":"66591","definition":"其中一人来或去，二人因而相见。","pronunciation":["만나다"]}],"audio":"/audio/0f752e1fec73c9742ede.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.937,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=49672","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"2","sourceLevel":"초급","day":54,"sequenceScore":2.4505,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["在同学聚会上没能好好和你聊聊，就要分开啦，真有点遗憾。","下次我们单独约个时间再见面吧。","我这辈子已经读过那本书八十多次了。"],"answer":0},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["在同学聚会上没能好好和你聊聊，就要分开啦，真有点遗憾。","下次我们单独约个时间再见面吧。","我这辈子已经读过那本书八十多次了。"],"answer":1}]}
